# Hashi: a gap cycles through one bridge, two and none, and moves survive a restart.
expect Connect islands · 0 of 105 solved
tap Hashi
tap Five islands
wait-for-id game-more
expect Starter · Five islands
expect Undo
expect Restart
tap Rules
expect Join islands with one or two straight bridges that never cross.
tap Difficulty
expect-missing Join islands
tap Play
wait-for-id game-more
tap-id route-0
expect Vertical 1,3 to 3,3: single
tap-id route-0
expect Vertical 1,3 to 3,3: double
clean
shot hashi-double
tap-id route-0
expect Vertical 1,3 to 3,3: blank
tap-id route-1
expect Horizontal 3,1 to 3,3: single
# Undo history is kept with the puzzle when the app closes.
restart
wait-for Starter · Five islands
expect Horizontal 3,1 to 3,3: single
tap-id game-undo
expect Horizontal 3,1 to 3,3: blank
expect Move undone.
tap-id game-undo
expect Vertical 1,3 to 3,3: double
# New game in More opens the next unsolved Hashi puzzle and keeps this one.
tap-id game-more
expect New game
expect Restart puzzle
expect Puzzles
clean
shot hashi-more
tap New game
wait-for-id game-more
expect-missing Five islands
expect Starter · Puzzle 2
tap-id game-more
tap Puzzles
expect In progress
clean
shot hashi-list
tap Five islands
wait-for-id game-more
expect Vertical 1,3 to 3,3: double
